sequenceDiagram
    actor Driver
    participant Svc as LocationTrackingService (FGS, Ch 46)
    participant Fused as FusedLocationProvider
    participant Filt as LocationFilter
    participant Str as LocationStreamer (WS+outbox, Ch 63/31)
    participant BE as Backend

    Driver->>Svc: start delivery
    Svc->>Fused: requestUpdates(BALANCED, interval=5s)
    loop during trip
        Fused-->>Svc: location fix
        Svc->>Filt: accept? (accuracy/jump)
        Filt-->>Svc: yes
        Svc->>Str: send(fix) over WebSocket
        Str->>BE: update (authed, Ch 19)
    end
    Driver->>Svc: delivery complete
    Svc->>Fused: stop updates
    Svc->>Svc: stopForeground + stopSelf (battery + privacy)
